## Order → AutoCount sales invoice

POST an order to the webhook:
```json
{
  "customerCode": "300-A001",
  "orderNo": "WEB-1001",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "P-001", "name": "Widget", "qty": 2, "price": 49.9 }
  ]
}
```
The webhook uses **Header Auth**: create a Header Auth credential (e.g. name `X-Api-Key`, a long random value) and send that header with every request. Never leave an order webhook open.

Set the account `500-0000` to your sales account.
